# Curriculum lesson content (.mdx): Prettier's MDX printer re-indents JSX
# components nested inside Markdown list items in ways that violate MDX's
# whitespace-sensitive JSX-in-list-item nesting rules. Verified, not
# theoretical: running `pnpm format` against all 876 notes broke 161 of
# them (`<WhereToCheck>` and similar components no longer parsed --
# packages/curriculum/scripts/check-note-mdx-compile.mjs went from
# 876/876 passing to 161 failing). This is a real, demonstrated
# incompatibility between Prettier's MDX formatter and this content's
# structure, not a style preference -- excluding it is deliberate.
packages/curriculum/content/**/*.mdx

